{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "So this is the refrigerator where the crime happened.": "",
  "Hm? The ice tray is melted. Or did someone forget to freeze it?": "",
  "Nah, couldn't be. Nobody's using ice in the winter, probably.": "",
  "And I didn't see anyone use it yesterday.": "",
  "Then why did it melt? That's interesting.": "",
  "This is Saori-san's desk. It's immaculate.": "",
  "Well, look who we're talking about.": "",
  "My desk is the one opposite hers. Seeing her clean desk is actually pretty motivating.": "",
  "\"Motivating\" huh?": "",
  "Is it the neat desk or the person who sits at it that's motivating you?": "",
  "Wh-What are you implying!?": "",
  "...Nothing. You're just an open book.": "",
  "Come on, Yagami-san, don't tease.": "",
  "I see my nameplate's still around.": "",
  "I'm sure Genda-sensei is holding on to it so you can come back whenever you want, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Objection. I doubt that, Hoshino-kun.": "",
  "I'd say Genda-sensei is just being lazy.": "",
  "He probably left it alone because he has no idea which type of trash it is or which trash can to use.": "",
  "That's the logical conclusion.": "",
  "Yeah, I could see that.": "",
  "You've got a ways to go still, Hoshino-kun. Your deductions don't take a person's character into account.": "",
  "Maybe so, but at least they're made with love, unlike someone here...": "",
  "Well, I suppose it could have been washed out with the rest of our containers in the kitchen?": "",
  "(Kamurocho is pretty tense right now, no thanks to the Matsugane Family and the Kyorei Clan at each other's throats.)": "",
  "(Better ask Higashi about it.)": "",
  "Pardon me, sir... but you look awful tired! I recommend a full-body de-stress package, pronto!": "",
  "Yes, I'm talkin' to <font_kind=yakuza_italic>you</font_kind>! I was thinkin' I could come over to your place sometime... and ease those throbbin' muscles.": "",
  "Yeaaah... So I'm not really interested in <font_kind=yakuza_italic>that</font_kind> kind of massage. I'll pass.": "",
  "What the heck, I never said I was gonna do anything weird! I'm a mobile massage therapist, for cryin' out loud!": "",
  "Oh. Whoops.": "",
  "You're darn right, \"whoops\"! Are there no actual health professionals here in Kamurocho...?": "",
  "Anyway, the name's Sakura Amamiya, and I've fixed busted backs and broken hearts from Sotenbori all the way to Tokyo!": "",
  "Broken hearts, huh? You're sounding awfully scammy right now, lady.": "",
  "Come on, that's just part of my bit! You'll understand once ya have your first session.": "",
  "Right now I'm offering my services for the very low price of 3,000 yen an hour. My hands are pure magic, or so I'm told!": "",
  "Yeah... Now I'm even more skeptical.": "",
  "Stop being a weirdo and just try it out! Or at least take my contact info.": "",
  "Well then, let's get ya set up right quick!": "",
  "Yeah, set me up good.": "",
  "I'm surprised, Yagami-san... Your muscles are actually quite tense. Is being a detective that tough?": "",
  "More or less. I do a little bit of everything, from investigating affairs to finding lost cats.": "",
  "Oh my... That does sound rather exhaustin'. But even so, I've never seen anyone wound up this bad...": "",
  "This ain't just a matter of being okay or not. If ya keep pushin' yourself like this, you'll end up losin' your life!": "",
  "...Am I gonna be okay?": "",
  "Yeah. I recommend a heavy dose of acupuncture, on the double.": "",
  "Tell me where ya feel the most pain, 'cause that's where the needles'll go.": "",
  "Hmm, I sure hope so! This's my first time stickin' a needle in someone, after all.": "",
  "Maybe. If everything goes accordin' to the luck of the needles...": "",
  "Ya might heal up and feel like a new man. Or ya might not, and suffer irreversible consequences!": "",
  "You... You mean I'll die!?": "",
  "Hahaha, I was just playin' around. Thought some Osaka-style humor would loosen ya up a bit.": "",
  "But... I'm kinda scared of needles. Will this really make me feel better?": "",
  "Well, I'm about to find out. So, let's get to puncturin'!": "",
  "What! Are you serious? Am I really going to be all right!?": "",
  "Since a session's 3,000 yen and each needle costs 1,000, I'll be using three needles on you.": "",
  "You want it... right... here?": "",
  "Irreversible consequences!? Just what are you trying to do to me!?": "",
  "Wow, that was quite a howl. You alright there, partner? Still alive, I hope!": "",
  "...And do you think that helped?": "",
  "Ah, glad to see you're back. Ready to get started?": "",
  "I'm gonna be usin' the needles again.": "",
  "Sure, I'll take it.": "",
  "Oh my, Yagami-san. You're awfully... rigid.": "",
  "I know. I was hoping your services could help.": "",
  "You just leave it to me. I think I've got this acupuncture thing down.": "",
  "...You <font_kind=yakuza_italic>think</font_kind> you've got it down?": "",
  "Probably. Alright, we're going for another three rounds. Where d'ya want me to start?": "",
  "Okay. I've definitely improved since last time.": "",
  "Don't tell me... you're still just using me for practice?": "",
  "What're ya sayin'? For only 3,000 yen, I get to experiment with the art of acupuncture and you get the experience!": "",
  "...Is it, though?": "",
  "It's a win-win situation!": "",
  "Yup. Thanks to you, I finally got the hang of it. Puncturin' people's skin with tiny little pins is one heck of a job!": "",
  "Well, let me know the next time you're feeling tense and I'll fix ya right up!": "",
  "(I'm pretty sure I've had more than enough...)": "",
  "How many times do I have to tell ya, I don't do nasty things like that!": "",
  "Oh? Then why'd you put your hands so close to my pecker? You were trying to get me off, weren't you, you dirty girl!": "",
  "Ugh! Unhand me, you fiend! Why can't men let a massage be a massage!?": "",
  "(Whoa, this doesn't look good.)": "",
  "Hey. You need to stop right now.": "",
  "Now you got my motor all wound up... Ooooh, I'm hummin' like a vacuum cleaner, baby! Time to clean the carpet!": "",
  "Yagami-san! Help me out here!": "",
  "What's he trying to do?": "",
  "Well, when I offered him a massage, he kept makin' dirty requests and now he won't leave me alone!": "",
  "Huh? The hell are you blubbering about? If you're lookin' to get yanked, then wait your goddamn turn!": "",
  "You do know that coercion is a serious crime, right? Get lost before things get much worse for you.": "",
  "Hey, I'm a paying customer! And what kinda sissy wants a regular massage anyway!? Now less talkin', more tuggin'!": "",
  "Ugh... That was not a happy ending... at all.": "",
  "Your ending should've come a long time ago. Next time, find somewhere that actually specializes in <font_kind=yakuza_italic>that</font_kind> kind of service.": "",
  "...That's what I've been trying to do!": "",
  "You really bailed me out there, Yagami-san. Can't thank ya enough!": "",
  "I could say the same to you. That needle worked wonders on me just now.": "",
  "Ooh, I know! Why don't I give ya massages half-off from now on? To express my appreciation and such.": "",
  "That would be awesome. But... I won't be getting anymore near-death experiences, right?": "",
  "It's possible. Luck of the needles, remember?": "",
  "Hey now...": "",
  "Ahaha. More Osaka humor, comin' at ya free of charge! And hey, if ya ever feel tired again, you know who to call.": "",
  "Gaaaaahhh!!!": "",
  "UWOOOOOOOOOHHH!!!": "",
  "It felt like my spine was being shattered by a shockwave of suffering! Are you sure these needles are safe!?": "",
  "Dude, how're ya so freaked out? You are a man, aren't ya? Grow a pair and calm the heck down. You'll live... I think.": "",
  "Even if I do survive, this is pure agony!": "",
  "Ahaha. If it hurts, that means it's working.": "",
  "Alright, where should I put this next one...": "",
  "Hmph!": "",
  "OOOOOOOOOOHHH!!!": "",
  "Gosh dangit, I seem to have missed again. Sorry 'bout that, sir.": "",
  "Well? How was it? Worked like a charm, I'm sure.": "",
  "Whoa! What's going on... I feel... better! Yeah! In fact, I'm feeling better than I ever have before!": "",
  "Right? Looks like my needles did their job. Lucky you.": "",
  "...Can we not talk about luck when it comes to putting needles in my body?": "",
  "G-Ggh!": "",
  "Whoa, that was incredible! I feel like a new man!": "",
  "Guess my needles were on point today. Hehe.": "",
  "All right! Onto the next one!": "",
  "Hmm... Take that!": "",
  "FFF... GHHH... NNN... OWWW!!!": "",
  "Oh, is that right? Feels good, don't it?": "",
  "...Ughhh...": "",
  "Holy...! It's like a surge of energy... is welling up deep within my bones!": "",
  "Well, well. Must be nice to be so young.": "",
  "Right... here!": "",
  "Nwoh!": "",
  "Ohh! Oooh! Whoaaa! I've got the power!!!": "",
  "Whew, that was some good practice. Ya sure do have a high threshold for pain... Bet I could torture ya all day!": "",
  "How about <font_kind=yakuza_italic>not</font_kind> doing that!": "",
  "Hah! You Tokyo folks really have no sense of humor. I bet ya wouldn't last a day in Osaka!": "",
  "Then I've decided Osaka scares me...": "",
  "Good, ya best not take Osaka lightly. Alrighty then, give me a ring if ya feel like getting another massage.": "",
  "(That... was the craziest massage I've had to date.)": "",
  "Try coercing my pickle! I tried and it don't listen. In fact... it tells me to smack you for getting in my way!": "",
  "Yeah? Well, my fists are telling me to shut you up first.": "",
  "Wait, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Ouch! What was that for!?": "",
  "Wh... Wh... Whoooooooaaaaaaa!!! What'd you do to me!? My muscles feel like loaves of bread rising in the oven!": "",
  "It's simple. Thanks to all the practice you gave me, I've finally mastered what I call the \"Essence of Acupuncture.\"": "",
  "You mean...": "",
  "I activated a special pressure point on your body. You should be feelin' like a champion right now.": "",
  "Consider it my special gift to you. Now let out all that extra energy and finish him off!": "",
  "Not sure how all that works, but I appreciate the help!": "",
  "You little punk... You think you can just waltz over here and ruin my chance to get rubbed!? You're dead meat!": "",
  "Whoa... he's gone. Hope he doesn't cause any more misunderstandings...": "",
  "See, ain'tcha glad we got through all those practice sessions?": "",
  "I wouldn't say I'm <font_kind=yakuza_italic>glad</font_kind>... but I guess all that torment was worth it in the end.": "",
  "I feel amazing now, thanks to you.": "",
  "Happy to hear it! Hope to see ya around!": "",
  "(Hm, I don't see anyone who looks like a client... Maybe I beat them here?)": "",
  "Are you Yagami?": "",
  "(Guess I can afford to wait a while.)": "",
  "Yes, I am Ruan Wang. I apologize for calling you out to a place like this.": "",
  "Yes, from Yagami Detective Agency. You're Wang-san, I take it?": "",
  "(His Japanese is a little stiff. Judging from his name, maybe he's Chinese?)": "",
  "I did not want anyone to listen in on our conversation.": "",
  "(That said, he sure stands out. Wonder what he does?)": "",
  "Yes. As I have written, I want you to search for a cat. This one.": "",
  "You had a job for me, right?": "",
  "Its name is Zhuang Shi.": "",
  "He is wandering around Kamurocho, but he is too quick for me to catch.": "",
  "A missing cat? Seems straightforward enough.": "",
  "More of the latter.": "",
  "Is he an indoor cat who got out? Or does he take strolls like this often?": "",
  "I should say... Zhuang Shi isn't my cat. He is the pet cat of... someone who passed away recently.": "",
  "Our boss. And let us simply say I am deeply indebted to him.": "",
  "We don't know where Zhuang Shi went after the boss passed.": "",
  "...Someone?": "",
  "But it is well known that he adored this cat.": "",
  "(This is getting sketchier and sketchier... Are these guys triads?)": "",
  "Even in his will, Zhuang Shi was the first order of business.": "",
  "Yes. That is why we must find Zhuang Shi and keep him safe. He cannot be allowed to become another stray.": "",
  "Sounds like a cat guy all right.": "",
  "Yes. You see, another executive member of our organization is also frantically seeking Zhuang Shi.": "",
  "Right. Well, I think everything's clear.": "",
  "Zhuang Shi cannot fall into this man's hands.": "",
  "And if he hears we are searching too, he will most certainly attempt to sabotage our efforts.": "",
  "That man does not seek the cat to repay our boss' kindness. He harbors no such sentimentality.": "",
  "But I admit, I thought we'd be talking about something a lot more secretive. Was coming here necessary?": "",
  "No. To him, all he sees is the true value of Zhuang Shi.": "",
  "I don't understand. Why can't you let this other guy find the cat?": "",
  "He knows the cat to be of tremendous value. He has said as much.": "",
  "This cat could change the face of our entire organization, in truth.": "",
  "True value?": "",
  "This must be some cat...": "",
  "Um, excuse me? I was hoping you could help me find the missing cat in this photo.": "",
  "Hmm, I do feel like I've seen that collar before...": "",
  "You have?": "",
  "Yeah, I meet lots of kitties when I go out gathering strays. I probably ran across him but couldn't catch him...": "",
  "Oh yeah, it was around Taihei Boulevard! He was wandering in that area.": "",
  "Taihei Boulevard? Thank you!": "",
  "Oh, before you go, sir...": "",
  "Cats aren't the most trusting little guys. They'll run away if you just come right up to them.": "",
  "What should I do, then?": "",
  "There's several tricks, actually. Basically, you need to use something to catch the cat's interest.": "",
  "Like a toy or something?": "",
  "Yes, something that moves. Or food works too.": "",
  "Makes sense.": "",
  "But it depends on how hungry the little guy is. If he's eating, food may not entice him.": "",
  "Here, I always keep food around. I'll give you a few cans.": "",
  "Really? Thanks a lot!": "",
  "I'm not doing this for you... This is for the cats.": "",
  "(Bait the cats with toys or food... Sounds like it's worth a shot.)": "",
  "(Guess I'll see if I can find this troublemaker on Taihei Boulevard.)": "",
  "Ah! Is that our boy?": "",
  "Here kitty, kitty! This is pretty tasty, right? Yeah that's right, you smell this?": "",
  "Tch, is he not hungry?": "",
  "Great, he went inside the Millennium Tower...": "",
  "Why do the doors even open for cats...?": "",
  "Where'd he go?": "",
  "Mrow...": "",
  "Hm? Was that him?": "",
  "I think it came from way above me.": "",
  "Bah, of course I can't reach him. What should I do?": "",
  "The guy at the café said maybe something that moved would entice him...": "",
  "Something that would make a cat want to chase it... What do I have?": "",
  "Mrowww.": "",
  "Yeah, that's right, kitty. You know what's good.": "",
  "Hey! I think this just might work.": "",
  "Who would dare attempt to beat me to this cat?": "",
  "Hey, what're you doing!?": "",
  "You seek Zhuang Shi as well? Was it Wang who hired you!?": "",
  "(Is this the guy Wang-san was talking about who wants Zhuang Shi for selfish reasons?)": "",
  "Sorry, but my client's none of your business. And you're not getting that cat.": "",
  "If words will not make you see... There are other ways.": "",
  "What's this cat mean to you? Why're you so desperate to get him?": "",
  "The kingdom is at stake, and that cat is the crown...": "",
  "A crown? You wanna be less cryptic?": "",
  "If you think this is just some alley cat... You're wrong.": "",
  "Get in the way again, and I won't hesitate to kill you.": "",
  "(How the hell is a cat a crown? Not something I should take literally I guess...)": "",
  "Now...": "",
  "I better get this fixed and then figure out how to deal with that weird weapon...": "",
  "I think Makihara-kun is just the guy for this.": "",
  "Sorry for calling you out suddenly, Makihara-kun.": "",
  "It's no problem. I was bored anyway.": "",
  "But what happened to your drone? You flying recklessly?": "",
  "Nah, I got into an argument with a real jerk and he shot it down.": "",
  "Wow, some people are so petty...": "",
  "Right? But do you think it can be repaired?": "",
  "Yeah man, no problem. This'll be cake.": "",
  "Great. But uh... While we're at it...": "",
  "I don't want it to get shot again. Do you have anything... bulletproof?": "",
  "Why would you plan on getting it shot at again, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Well, I seem to run into a lot of jerks in my line of work...": "",
  "Shoot them first? You mean like... add a gun mod?": "",
  "I see. In that case...": "",
  "Sometimes a good defense is a good offense. Why not shoot them first?": "",
  "Yeah, something like that. But that would be kind of costly...": "",
  "(Yikes. Pretty steep. But it's gotta be worth getting a gun mod on this thing...)": "",
  "I think I could do it for 100,000 yen.": "",
  "Sure, sounds like a plan.": "",
  "Okay, I'll get to work.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Hey now...": "เฮ้ เดี๋ยวก่อน...",
  "Hmph!": "ชิ!",
  "You mean...": "แกหมายความว่า...",
  "Makes sense.": "เข้าใจแล้ว",
  "Mrow...": "เมี้ยว...",
  "Mrowww.": "เมี้ยววว",
  "Hey, what're you doing!?": "เฮ้ย ทำอะไรน่ะ!?",
  "Now...": "เอาล่ะ..."
 }
}
